{"type":"message","id":"5d782eb4","parentId":"6807d453","timestamp":"2026-02-26T11:24:05.244Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_5feef8537d074620beab1e7c","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# AutoClaw Skill\n\n## 描述\nOpenClaw 浏览器自动化技能，支持书签管理、页面操作等。\n\n## 工具\n\n### 书签管理\n- `claw_get_bookmarks` - 获取所有书签\n- `claw_get_bookmark_tree` - 获取书签树\n- `claw_search_bookmarks` - 搜索书签\n\n### 页面操作\n- `claw_navigate` - 打开网址\n- `claw_click_element` - 点击元素\n- `claw_fill_input` - 填写输入\n- `claw_take_screenshot` - 截图\n\n## MCP配置\n\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"autoclaw\": {\n      \"url\": \"ws://127.0.0.1:49666/extension\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## 使用示例\n- \"打开百度\" -> claw_navigate {url: \"https://www.baidu.com\"}\n- \"获取收藏夹\" -> claw_get_bookmarks\n- \"搜索书签 Python\" -> claw_search_bookmarks {query: \"Python\"}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772105045239}}
