{"type":"message","id":"19228db0","parentId":"06a586fa","timestamp":"2026-02-26T11:30:48.789Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                                                                这是一个常见的问题！插件图标显示OFF通常有几个原因：\n\n## 🔍 可能的原因和解决方案\n\n### 1. **插件未正确连接**\n虽然Gateway运行正常，但插件可能没有成功建立WebSocket连接。\n\n**检查方法：**\n- 打开Chrome扩展管理页面 `chrome://extensions`\n- 找到autoclaw插件，查看详情页面\n- 检查连接状态和错误信息\n\n### 2. **Token配置问题**\n插件中配置的Token可能需要包含前缀或特定格式。\n\n**建议配置：**\n```\n端口: 18789\nToken: hanzhong_Q0hpK2oV4F9tlwbYX3RELxiJNGDvayr8OPqZzkfs\n```\n（注意：添加 `hanzhong_` 前缀）\n\n### 3. **权限问题**\n插件可能需要额外的权限来访问Gateway。\n\n**需要权限：**\n- 访问 `http://127.0.0.1:18789/`\n- WebSocket连接权限\n\n### 4. **插件配置页面**\n让我帮您打开插件配置页面："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_6dfef39d8c6f4051a9513ce5","name":"browser","arguments":{"action":"navigate","targetUrl":"chrome://extensions"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":38064,"output":257,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":38321,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772105380538}}
