{"type":"message","id":"d99c2fc3","parentId":"72476705","timestamp":"2026-02-26T11:32:47.115Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                                                      这说明插件的前端验证逻辑有问题！让我帮您检查插件的实际连接状态。\n\n## 🔍 问题分析\n\n插件显示\"授权成功\"(绿色)但图标显示OFF，说明：\n\n1. **前端验证过于简单** - 只检查Token非空就显示成功\n2. **实际WebSocket连接失败** - 后台连接没有建立\n3. **状态同步问题** - 插件图标状态没有更新\n\n## 🛠️ 深度测试方法\n\n让我创建一个测试脚本来验证实际的WebSocket连接："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_4033760992c4448f86dc14d1","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\lenovo\\.openclaw\\workspace\\test_connection.js","content":"const WebSocket = require('ws');\n\nconsole.log('🔍 测试AutoClaw插件实际连接状态');\n\n// 测试不同的Token格式\nconst testTokens = [\n  'Q0hpK2oV4F9tlwbYX3RELxiJNGDvayr8OPqZzkfs',\n  'hanzhong_Q0hpK2oV4F9tlwbYX3RELxiJNGDvayr8OPqZzkfs',\n  'test_token',\n  'invalid_token'\n];\n\nasync function testConnection(token) {\n  console.log(`\\n🧪 测试Token: ${token}`);\n  \n  try {\n    const wsUrl = `ws://127.0.0.1:18789/extension?token=${encodeURIComponent(token)}`;\n    console.log(`   WebSocket地址: ${wsUrl}`);\n    \n    const ws = new WebSocket(wsUrl);\n    \n    // 设置超时\n    const timeout = setTimeout(() => {\n      console.log('   ❌ 连接超时 (3秒)');\n      ws.close();\n    }, 3000);\n    \n    ws.on('open', () => {\n      clearTimeout(timeout);\n      console.log('   ✅ WebSocket连接成功!');\n      ws.close();\n    });\n    \n    ws.on('error', (error) => {\n      clearTimeout(timeout);\n      console.log('   ❌ WebSocket连接失败:', error.message);\n    });\n    \n    ws.on('close', () => {\n      console.log('   🔗 连接已关闭');\n    });\n    \n  } catch (error) {\n    console.log('   💥 测试异常:', error.message);\n  }\n}\n\nasync function runTests() {\n  console.log('=== AutoClaw连接深度测试 ===');\n  console.log('Gateway状态: 运行中 (端口18789)');\n  \n  for (const token of testTokens) {\n    await testConnection(token);\n  }\n  \n  console.log('\\n📋 测试总结:');\n  console.log('- 如果所有Token都\"成功\": 前端验证有问题');\n  console.log('- 如果只有正确Token成功: 插件状态同步问题');\n  console.log('- 如果全部失败: Gateway配置问题');\n}\n\nrunTests();"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":38875,"output":723,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39598,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772105525336}}
