{"type":"message","id":"abfa4494","parentId":"72400113","timestamp":"2026-02-26T11:34:01.728Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                                                                        **🚨 发现问题了！**\n\n**测试结果显示：所有Token都能连接成功！**  \n这说明Gateway的token验证机制没有正常工作，或者配置有问题。\n\n## 🔧 问题诊断\n\n1. **Gateway配置问题** - token验证未启用或配置错误\n2. **权限设置问题** - 可能允许所有连接\n\n## 🛠️ 解决方案\n\n### 1. 检查Gateway配置\n让我检查openclaw.json的auth配置："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_0d0d4dc8099a42ccad3b8d12","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\lenovo\\.openclaw\\openclaw.json","offset":40,"limit":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":40082,"output":139,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":40221,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772105627924}}
