{"type":"message","id":"7d5cdd23","parentId":"e6c879fd","timestamp":"2026-02-26T12:18:02.424Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"          "},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_8168e677c9e34c4c92f9701e","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\lenovo\\.openclaw\\skills\\claw-browser\\examples\\basic-usage.md","content":"# Basic Usage Examples\n\n## 📋 Quick Start Guide\n\n### Prerequisites\n- OpenClaw Gateway running on port 18789\n- Valid authentication token\n- Chrome browser with AutoClaw extension installed\n\n### 1. Start MCP Server\n\n```bash\n# Using PowerShell (Windows)\n.\\scripts\\start-mcp.ps1\n\n# Using bash (Linux/Mac)\n./scripts/start-mcp.sh\n```\n\n### 2. Configure Chrome Extension\n\n1. Open `chrome://extensions`\n2. Enable \"Developer mode\"\n3. Click \"Load unpacked\"\n4. Select `autoclaw-plugin` directory\n5. Configure settings:\n   - Port: `18789`\n   - Token: `Your_Gateway_Token`\n\n### 3. Test Basic Commands\n\n```bash\n# Navigate to website\nclaw_navigate --url \"https://example.com\"\n\n# Take screenshot\nclaw_take_screenshot\n\n# Get bookmarks\nclaw_get_bookmarks\n```\n\n## 🔧 Common Use Cases\n\n### Website Navigation\n\n```bash\n# Simple navigation\nclaw_navigate --url \"https://github.com\"\n\n# Navigate with delay (wait for page load)\nclaw_navigate --url \"https://example.com\" && sleep 3\n\n# Multiple navigations\nclaw_navigate --url \"https://google.com\"\nclaw_navigate --url \"https://github.com\"\nclaw_navigate --url \"https://npmjs.com\"\n```\n\n### Form Interaction\n\n```bash\n# Fill login form\nclaw_navigate --url \"https://example.com/login\"\nclaw_fill_input --selector \"#username\" --text \"your_username\"\nclaw_fill_input --selector \"#password\" --text \"your_password\"\nclaw_click_element --selector \"#login-button\"\n\n# Search on website\nclaw_navigate --url \"https://google.com\"\nclaw_fill_input --selector \"[name='q']\" --text \"OpenClaw\"\nclaw_click_element --selector \"[name='btnK']\"\n```\n\n### Screenshot Capture\n\n```bash\n# Capture current page\nclaw_take_screenshot\n\n# Navigate and capture\nclaw_navigate --url \"https://example.com\"\nclaw_take_screenshot\n\n# Capture multiple pages\nclaw_navigate --url \"https://page1.com\" && claw_take_screenshot\nclaw_navigate --url \"https://page2.com\" && claw_take_screenshot\nclaw_navigate --url \"https://page3.com\" && claw_take_screenshot\n```\n\n### Bookmark Management\n\n```bash\n# Get all bookmarks\nclaw_get_bookmarks\n\n# Get bookmark tree structure\nclaw_get_bookmark_tree\n\n# Search bookmarks\nclaw_search_bookmarks --query \"work\"\nclaw_search_bookmarks --query \"personal\"\nclaw_search_bookmarks --query \"important\"\n```\n\n## ⚡ Advanced Examples\n\n### Automated Testing Workflow\n\n```bash\n# Test login functionality\nclaw_navigate --url \"https://example.com/login\"\nclaw_fill_input --selector \"#email\" --text \"test@example.com\"\nclaw_fill_input --selector \"#password\" -- text \"test123\"\nclaw_click_element --selector \"button[type='submit']\"\nclaw_take_screenshot\n\n# Verify login success\nclaw_navigate --url \"https://example.com/dashboard\"\nclaw_take_screenshot\n```\n\n### Data Extraction\n\n```bash\n# Extract information from multiple pages\nclaw_navigate --url \"https://news-site.com/page1\"\nclaw_take_screenshot\n\nclaw_navigate --url \"https://news-site.com/page2\"\nclaw_take_screenshot\n\nclaw_navigate --url \"https://news-site.com/page3\"\nclaw_take_screenshot\n```\n\n### Monitoring Script\n\n```bash\n# Monitor website status\nclaw_navigate --url \"https://your-app.com/health\"\nclaw_take_screenshot\n\n# Check API status\nclaw_navigate --url \"https://api.example.com/status\"\nclaw_take_screenshot\n\n# Verify content updates\nclaw_navigate --url \"https://blog.example.com/latest\"\nclaw_take_screenshot\n```\n\n## 🎯 Best Practices\n\n### 1. Add Delays for Page Loads\n```bash\n# Wait 2 seconds after navigation\nclaw_navigate --url \"https://example.com\" && sleep 2\nclaw_take_screenshot\n```\n\n### 2. Use Specific Selectors\n```bash\n# Good - specific selector\nclaw_click_element --selector \"button#submit-button\"\n\n# Bad - vague selector  \nclaw_click_element --selector \"button\"\n```\n\n### 3. Error Handling\n```bash\n# Check if page loaded successfully\nclaw_navigate --url \"https://example.com\"\n# Add logic to verify page title or content\n```\n\n### 4. Resource Management\n```bash\n# Close unnecessary tabs\n# Manage browser memory usage\n# Monitor performance\n```\n\n## 🐛 Troubleshooting Common Issues\n\n### Extension shows \"OFF\" status\n- Verify OpenClaw Gateway is running\n- Check token configuration\n- Confirm port 18789 is accessible\n\n### \"Element not found\" errors\n- Add delays for page loading\n- Use more specific CSS selectors\n- Verify element exists on page\n\n### Connection timeouts\n- Check network connectivity\n- Verify Gateway is responsive\n- Review firewall settings\n\n### Performance issues\n- Reduce number of simultaneous operations\n- Add delays between actions\n- Monitor browser memory usage\n\n## 📊 Performance Tips\n\n- **Batch operations**: Group related actions together\n- **Add delays**: Allow time for page rendering\n- **Use efficient selectors**: Specific > general selectors\n- **Monitor resources**: Watch browser memory usage\n- **Clean up**: Close unused tabs and sessions\n\n---\n\n**Next Steps**:\n- Try the basic navigation examples\n- Experiment with form interactions\n- Explore bookmark management\n- Build automated workflows"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":91040,"output":1480,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":92520,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772108134279}}
