{"type":"message","id":"42817435","parentId":"d4f64c54","timestamp":"2026-02-26T12:20:45.501Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                                                                                                          现在让我创建高级配置示例"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_87d37ceb12174acd9c7b3e41","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\lenovo\\.openclaw\\skills\\claw-browser\\examples\\advanced-config.md","content":"# Advanced Configuration\n\n## 🎛️ MCP Server Configuration\n\n### Custom Port Configuration\n\nModify `autoclaw-mcp/src/server.ts`:\n\n```typescript\n// Change MCP server port\nconst MCP_PORT = 59667; // Default: 49667\n\n// Change Gateway port (must match OpenClaw config)\nconst GATEWAY_PORT = 18789; // Must match openclaw.json\n\n// Custom connection timeout\nconst CONNECTION_TIMEOUT = 10000; // 10 seconds\n\n// Enable detailed logging\nconst DEBUG_LOGGING = true;\n```\n\n### Environment Variables\n\n```bash\n# Custom MCP port\nexport MCP_PORT=59667\n\n# Custom Gateway port\nexport GATEWAY_PORT=18789\n\n# Enable debug mode\nexport DEBUG=*\n\n# Connection timeout\nexport CONNECTION_TIMEOUT=15000\n```\n\n### Production Configuration\n\n```typescript\n// Production settings\nconst config = {\n  port: process.env.MCP_PORT || 49667,\n  gatewayPort: process.env.GATEWAY_PORT || 18789,\n  timeout: parseInt(process.env.CONNECTION_TIMEOUT || '10000'),\n  maxRetries: 3,\n  retryDelay: 2000,\n  enableCompression: true,\n  logLevel: process.env.NODE_ENV === 'production' ? 'warn' : 'debug'\n};\n```\n\n## 🔧 Chrome Extension Configuration\n\n### Manifest Configuration (`autoclaw-plugin/manifest.json`)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"manifest_version\": 3,\n  \"name\": \"autoclaw\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"description\": \"OpenClaw Browser Automation Controller\",\n  \n  \"permissions\": [\n    \"debugger\",\n    \"tabs\", \n    \"activeTab\",\n    \"storage\",\n    \"bookmarks\",\n    \"scripting\"\n  ],\n  \n  \"host_permissions\": [\n    \"http://127.0.0.1/*\",\n    \"http://localhost/*\",\n    \"https://*/*\"\n  ],\n  \n  \"background\": {\n    \"service_worker\": \"background.js\",\n    \"type\": \"module\"\n  },\n  \n  \"action\": {\n    \"default_title\": \"autoclaw - Click to control browser\"\n  },\n  \n  \"options_ui\": {\n    \"page\": \"options.html\",\n    \"open_in_tab\": true\n  },\n  \n  \"content_security_policy\": {\n    \"extension_pages\": \"script-src 'self'; object-src 'self'\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Extension Options Customization\n\nModify `autoclaw-plugin/options.js`:\n\n```javascript\n// Default configuration\nconst defaultConfig = {\n  port: 18789,\n  token: '',\n  autoAttachAll: true,\n  connectionTimeout: 5000,\n  maxReconnectAttempts: 3,\n  enableLogging: false,\n  captureScreenshots: true,\n  defaultWaitTime: 2000\n};\n\n// Advanced settings\nconst advancedSettings = {\n  enablePerformanceMonitoring: true,\n  memoryUsageThreshold: 80, // %\n  cpuUsageThreshold: 70,     // %\n  maxTabCount: 10,\n  sessionTimeout: 300000,    // 5 minutes\n  enableAutoRecovery: true\n};\n```\n\n## 🌐 OpenClaw Gateway Configuration\n\n### Gateway Configuration (`openclaw.json`)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"gateway\": {\n    \"port\": 18789,\n    \"mode\": \"local\",\n    \"bind\": \"loopback\",\n    \"auth\": {\n      \"mode\": \"token\",\n      \"token\": \"your_secure_token_here\",\n      \"tokenExpiry\": \"7d\",\n      \"maxConnections\": 10,\n      \"rateLimit\": {\n        \"requests\": 100,\n        \"window\": \"1m\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"ssl\": {\n      \"enabled\": false,\n      \"key\": \"/path/to/key.pem\",\n      \"cert\": \"/path/to/cert.pem\"\n    },\n    \"logging\": {\n      \"level\": \"info\",\n      \"file\": \"/var/log/openclaw/gateway.log\",\n      \"maxSize\": \"10m\",\n      \"maxFiles\": 5\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### SSL Configuration (Production)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"gateway\": {\n    \"port\": 18789,\n    \"mode\": \"local\",\n    \"bind\": \"0.0.0.0\",\n    \"auth\": {\n      \"mode\": \"token\",\n      \"token\": \"your_production_token\"\n    },\n    \"ssl\": {\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"key\": \"/etc/ssl/private/gateway.key\",\n      \"cert\": \"/etc/ssl/certs/gateway.crt\",\n      \"ca\": \"/etc/ssl/certs/ca-bundle.crt\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## 🔒 Security Configuration\n\n### Token Management\n\n```bash\n# Generate secure token\nopenssl rand -base64 32\n\n# Environment-based tokens\nexport OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_TOKEN=\"$(openssl rand -base64 32)\"\n\n# Token rotation script\n#!/bin/bash\n# Rotate gateway token monthly\nNEW_TOKEN=$(openssl rand -base64 32)\nsed -i \"s/\\\"token\\\": \\\".*\\\"/\\\"token\\\": \\\"$NEW_TOKEN\\\"/\" openclaw.json\nsystemctl restart openclaw-gateway\n```\n\n### Network Security\n\n```bash\n# Firewall rules (Linux)\nufw allow 18789/tcp\nufw allow 49667/tcp\n\n# Windows Firewall\nNew-NetFirewallRule -DisplayName \"OpenClaw Gateway\" -Direction Inbound -Protocol TCP -LocalPort 18789 -Action Allow\nNew-NetFirewallRule -DisplayName \"AutoClaw MCP\" -Direction Inbound -Protocol TCP -LocalPort 49667 -Action Allow\n```\n\n### Access Control\n\n```json\n{\n  \"gateway\": {\n    \"auth\": {\n      \"mode\": \"token\",\n      \"token\": \"your_token\",\n      \"allowedIPs\": [\"127.0.0.1\", \"192.168.1.0/24\"],\n      \"blockedIPs\": [\"10.0.0.0/8\"],\n      \"maxConnectionsPerIP\": 3\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## 📊 Performance Optimization\n\n### MCP Server Optimization\n\n```typescript\n// Server optimization settings\nconst serverConfig = {\n  // Connection pool settings\n  maxConnections: 100,\n  connectionTimeout: 10000,\n  \n  // Memory management\n  maxMemoryUsage: 1024 * 1024 * 100, // 100MB\n  \n  // Request processing\n  maxPendingRequests: 50,\n  requestTimeout: 30000,\n  \n  // Logging optimization\n  logLevel: process.env.NODE_ENV === 'production' ? 'warn' : 'debug',\n  logFile: process.env.NODE_ENV === 'production' ? '/var/log/autoclaw.log' : null\n};\n```\n\n### Browser Performance\n\n```javascript\n// Browser performance settings\nconst performanceSettings = {\n  // Memory management\n  maxMemoryUsage: 512, // MB\n  garbageCollectionInterval: 30000, // 30 seconds\n  \n  // Tab management\n  maxTabs: 5,\n  tabTimeout: 300000, // 5 minutes\n  \n  // Network settings\n  requestTimeout: 30000,\n  downloadTimeout: 120000,\n  \n  // Rendering optimization\n  viewportWidth: 1920,\n  viewportHeight: 1080,\n  deviceScaleFactor: 1\n};\n```\n\n## 🚀 Deployment Configurations\n\n### Docker Deployment\n\n```dockerfile\n# Dockerfile for MCP Server\nFROM node:18-alpine\n\nWORKDIR /app\n\nCOPY autoclaw-mcp/package*.json ./\nRUN npm install --production\n\nCOPY autoclaw-mcp/ ./\nRUN npm run build\n\nEXPOSE 49667\n\nCMD [\"node\", \"dist/server.js\"]\n```\n\n### Systemd Service (Linux)\n\n```ini\n# /etc/systemd/system/autoclaw-mcp.service\n[Unit]\nDescription=AutoClaw MCP Server\nAfter=network.target\n\n[Service]\nType=simple\nUser=openclaw\nWorkingDirectory=/opt/autoclaw/autoclaw-mcp\nEnvironment=NODE_ENV=production\nEnvironment=MCP_PORT=49667\nEnvironment=GATEWAY_PORT=18789\nExecStart=/usr/bin/node dist/server.js\nRestart=always\nRestartSec=10\n\n[Install]\nWantedBy=multi-user.target\n```\n\n### Kubernetes Deployment\n\n```yaml\n# autoclaw-deployment.yaml\napiVersion: apps/v1\nkind: Deployment\nmetadata:\n  name: autoclaw-mcp\nspec:\n  replicas: 2\n  selector:\n    matchLabels:\n      app: autoclaw-mcp\n  template:\n    metadata:\n      labels:\n        app: autoclaw-mcp\n    spec:\n      containers:\n      - name: autoclaw-mcp\n        image: autoclaw-mcp:1.0.0\n        ports:\n        - containerPort: 49667\n        env:\n        - name: NODE_ENV\n          value: \"production\"\n        - name: MCP_PORT\n          value: \"49667\"\n        - name: GATEWAY_PORT\n          value: \"18789\"\n---\napiVersion: v1\nkind: Service\nmetadata:\n  name: autoclaw-mcp-service\nspec:\n  selector:\n    app: autoclaw-mcp\n  ports:\n  - protocol: TCP\n    port: 49667\n    targetPort: 49667\n```\n\n## 📈 Monitoring & Logging\n\n### Performance Monitoring\n\n```bash\n# Monitor MCP server\ncurl http://localhost:49667/health\n\n# Monitor Gateway\ncurl http://localhost:18789/health\n\n# Performance metrics\ncurl http://localhost:49667/metrics\n```\n\n### Logging Configuration\n\n```javascript\n// Structured logging\nconst logger = {\n  info: (message, meta = {}) => {\n    console.log(JSON.stringify({\n      level: 'info',\n      timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),\n      message,\n      ...meta\n    }))\n  },\n  error: (message, error = {}) => {\n    console.error(JSON.stringify({\n      level: 'error',\n      timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),\n      message,\n      error: error.message,\n      stack: error.stack\n    }))\n  }\n};\n```\n\n### Alerting Configuration\n\n```yaml\n# Alert rules\nalerts:\n  - name: high_cpu_usage\n    condition: cpu_usage > 80\n    duration: 5m\n    severity: warning\n    \n  - name: memory_leak\n    condition: memory_"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"aborted","timestamp":1772108282444,"errorMessage":"Request was aborted"}}
