{"type":"message","id":"a3ba67f3","parentId":"c77b6a28","timestamp":"2026-02-26T12:30:45.716Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                                                                                                     现在让我创建一个总结文档，展示完成的标准结构"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_c401b440474143869efd4496","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"D:\\工作报告\\20260226_02_AutoClaw标准化构建_完成报告.md","content":"# AutoClaw 标准化构建完成报告\n\n## 📋 项目概述\n\n**任务**: 将 `claw-browser` 技能按照 OpenClaw 行业标准进行规范化重构\n**完成时间**: 2026-02-26 20:20\n**状态**: ✅ 完成\n\n## 🎯 完成内容\n\n### 1. 核心技能文件创建\n- ✅ **SKILL.md** - 标准技能描述文件\n- ✅ **README.md** - 详细使用文档\n- ✅ **package.json** - 完整的项目配置和版本管理\n\n### 2. 标准化目录结构\n```\nclaw-browser/\n├── SKILL.md                 # 技能主文档\n├── README.md               # 详细说明文档\n├── autoclaw-mcp/           # MCP服务器\n│   ├── src/server.ts      # 服务器代码\n│   ├── package.json       # 项目配置（已更新）\n│   └── dist/              # 编译输出\n├── autoclaw-plugin/       # 浏览器插件\n│   ├── background.js      # 后台逻辑\n│   ├── options.js         # 配置页面\n│   ├── manifest.json      # 插件清单\n│   └── options.html       # HTML界面\n├── scripts/               # ✅ 新增功能脚本\n│   ├── start-mcp.sh       # Linux/Mac启动脚本\n│   ├── start-mcp.ps1      # Windows启动脚本\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"aborted","timestamp":1772109009872,"errorMessage":"Request was aborted"}}
