{"type":"message","id":"37cd901a","parentId":"d8321e48","timestamp":"2026-02-26T13:19:11.422Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"我理解您需要CSP配置、18789端口服务代码和插件连接代码。让我为您提供这些信息：\n\n## 🔧 CSP 配置\n\n**OpenClaw Gateway CSP配置** (`openclaw.json`):\n```json\n{\n  \"gateway\": {\n    \"port\": 18789,\n    \"mode\": \"local\",\n    \"bind\": \"loopback\",\n    \"auth\": {\n      \"mode\": \"token\",\n      \"token\": \"Q0hpK2oV4F9tlwbYX3RELxiJNGDvayr8OPqZzkfs\"\n    },\n    \"csp\": {\n      \"connect-src\": \"'self' ws://127.0.0.1:18789\",\n      \"default-src\": \"'self'\",\n      \"script-src\": \"'self' 'unsafe-inline'\",\n      \"style-src\": \"'self' 'unsafe-inline'\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## 🌐 18789端口服务代码\n\n**Gateway服务器核心代码** (`server.ts`):\n```typescript\nimport express from 'express';\nimport WebSocket from 'ws';\nimport cors from 'cors';\n\nconst PORT = 18789;\nconst app = express();\n\napp.use(cors());\napp.use(express.json());\n\n// WebSocket连接处理\nconst wss = new WebSocket.Server({ port: PORT });\n\nwss.on('connection', (ws, req) => {\n  const token = new URL(req.url!, `ws://${req.headers.host}`).searchParams.get('token');\n  \n  if (!token || token !== process.env.GATEWAY_TOKEN) {\n    ws.close(1008, 'Invalid token');\n    return;\n  }\n\n  ws.on('message', (data) => {\n    // 处理MCP消息\n    console.log('Received:', data.toString());\n  });\n\n  ws.send(JSON.stringify({ type: 'connected', timestamp: Date.now() }));\n});\n\nconsole.log(`Gateway running on port ${PORT}`);\n```\n\n## 🔌 插件连接代码\n\n**Chrome Extension连接代码** (`background.js`):\n```javascript\nlet gatewaySocket = null;\n\nasync function connectToGateway(port, token) {\n  return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\n    const wsUrl = `ws://127.0.0.1:${port}/extension?token=${encodeURIComponent(token)}`;\n    \n    gatewaySocket = new WebSocket(wsUrl);\n    \n    gatewaySocket.onopen = () => {\n      console.log('Connected to OpenClaw Gateway');\n      resolve(gatewaySocket);\n    };\n    \n    gatewaySocket.onerror = (error) => {\n      console.error('Connection failed:', error);\n      reject(error);\n    };\n    \n    gatewaySocket.onmessage = (event) => {\n      handleGatewayMessage(JSON.parse(event.data));\n    };\n  });\n}\n\nfunction handleGatewayMessage(message) {\n  switch (message.type) {\n    case 'navigate':\n      chrome.tabs.update({ url: message.url });\n      break;\n    case 'click_element':\n      chrome.debugger.sendCommand({ tabId: message.tabId }, 'DOM.performSearch', {\n        selector: message.selector\n      });\n      break;\n    case 'screenshot':\n      chrome.tabs.captureVisibleTab(null, { format: 'png' }, (dataUrl) => {\n        gatewaySocket.send(JSON.stringify({\n          type: 'screenshot_result',\n          data: dataUrl\n        }));\n      });\n      break;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## 📋 完整配置要点\n\n1. **CSP安全策略** - 限制连接源和脚本执行\n2. **Token认证** - 所有连接必须提供有效token  \n3. **WebSocket通信** - 实时双向通信通道\n4. **错误处理** - 完善的连接失败处理机制\n5. **消息协议** - 标准化的JSON消息格式\n\n需要我详细解释任何部分吗？ 🔥"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":53761,"output":827,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":54588,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772111913257}}
{"type":"message","id":"10e694a3","parentId":"37cd901a","timestamp":"2026-02-26T13:19:58.644Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"ff237c9f-c31c-47f9-9233-f41fb481a209\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"openclaw-control-ui\",\n  \"sender\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Thu 2026-02-26 21:19 GMT+8] 并给我这个插件介绍下，以及插件和openclaw可能错误的原因也告诉我"}],"timestamp":1772111998634}}
