{"type":"message","id":"e5639811","parentId":"94ace193","timestamp":"2026-02-26T14:11:22.612Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_b123a1e0a59543cf99e49954","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"| `claw_get_bookmarks` | 获取所有书签（扁平列表） | — |\n| `claw_get_bookmark_tree` | 获取书签树（含文件夹） | — |\n| `claw_search_bookmarks` | 搜索书签 | `query: string` |\n| `claw_create_bookmark` | 新建书签 | `title, url, [parentId]` |\n| `claw_update_bookmark` | 修改书签 | `id, [title], [url]` |\n| `claw_delete_bookmark` | 删除书签 | `id: string` |\n| `claw_create_folder` | 新建文件夹 | `title, [parentId]` |\n| `claw_move_bookmark` | 移动书签 | `id, parentId` |\n\n### 🌐 页面操作\n\n| 工具 | 用途 | 参数 |\n|------|------|------|\n| `claw_navigate` | 打开网址 | `url: string` |\n| `claw_get_current_url` | 获取当前URL/标题 | — |\n| `claw_click_element` | 点击元素 | `selector: string` |\n| `claw_fill_input` | 填写输入框 | `selector, text` |\n| `claw_take_screenshot` | 截图（返回base64） | — |\n| `claw_get_page_content` | 获取页面内容 | `[type: 'html'|'text']` |\n| `claw_evaluate_js` | 执行JavaScript | `expression: string` |\n\n[100 more lines in file. Use offset=70 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772115082597}}
