{"type":"message","id":"73c346a8","parentId":"b76f1309","timestamp":"2026-02-26T14:34:32.834Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"您观察得很仔细！确实，MCP服务器返回了\"已导航到\"的响应，但这只是表示**指令已经成功发送给浏览器插件**，并不代表页面已经在您的当前浏览器窗口中打开。\n\n让我解释一下技术细节：\n\n## 🔍 技术架构分析\n\n**当前的claw-browser架构**：\n```\nOpenClaw → MCP服务器 → Chrome扩展 → 浏览器实例\n```\n\n### 可能的情况：\n\n1. **扩展连接到不同的浏览器实例** \n   - 可能连接到了后台的Chrome实例\n   - 不是在您当前看到的前台窗口\n\n2. **页面在新标签页打开**\n   - 导航操作可能在新标签页进行\n   - 没有聚焦到前台\n\n3. **扩展连接状态问题**\n   - 虽然MCP通信成功，但扩展可能没有正确附加到当前标签页\n\n## 🛠️ 立即验证方法\n\n### 方法一：检查浏览器标签页\n1. 打开Chrome浏览器\n2. 查看所有标签页，寻找央视直播页面\n3. 检查是否有新打开的标签页\n\n### 方法二：手动验证导航\n直接在地址栏输入：`https://tv.cctv.com/live`\n\n### 方法三：检查扩展状态\n1. 打开 `chrome://extensions`\n2. 找到AutoClaw扩展\n3. 查看详情中的连接状态\n\n## 🔧 深度诊断\n\n让我测试扩展的实际连接状态"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_a1fe5b89bcee4a709c45295d","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\lenovo\\.openclaw\\workspace\\test_extension_status.js","content":"const WebSocket = require('ws');\n\nconsole.log('🔍 检查扩展连接状态...');\n\nconst wsUrl = 'ws://127.0.0.1:30000/mcp';\n\nconst message = {\n  jsonrpc: \"2.0\",\n  id: 3,\n  method: \"tools/call\",\n  params: {\n    name: \"claw_get_current_url\",\n    arguments: {}\n  }\n};\n\nconsole.log('检查当前标签页URL...');\n\ntry {\n    const ws = new WebSocket(wsUrl);\n    \n    ws.on('open', function open() {\n        console.log('✅ MCP连接成功');\n        ws.send(JSON.stringify(message));\n        console.log('📤 已发送状态检查请求');\n    });\n    \n    ws.on('message', function incoming(data) {\n        const response = JSON.parse(data.toString());\n        console.log('📥 收到响应:', JSON.stringify(response, null, 2));\n        \n        if (response.result && response.result.content) {\n            const content = response.result.content[0].text;\n            console.log('🌐 当前标签页信息:', content);\n        }\n        \n        ws.close();\n        process.exit(0);\n    });\n    \n    ws.on('error', function error(err) {\n        console.log('❌ 连接错误:', err.message);\n        process.exit(1);\n    });\n    \n    setTimeout(() => {\n        console.log('⏰ 响应超时');\n        ws.close();\n        process.exit(1);\n    }, 10000);\n    \n} catch (error) {\n    console.log('💥 测试异常:', error.message);\n    process.exit(1);\n}"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":79002,"output":779,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":79781,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772116404468}}
