{"type":"message","id":"dee3da12","parentId":"5c5abf5b","timestamp":"2026-02-26T14:39:08.777Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_4c4d7daf4a1f4fd9997c0468","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🔄 在当前标签页打开抖音...\n在当前标签页导航到: https://www.douyin.com\n✅ MCP连接成功\n📤 已发送获取当前URL请求\n📥 当前标签页信息接收完成\n📤 已发送导航请求\n📥 导航响应: {\n  \"id\": 6,\n  \"result\": {\n    \"content\": [\n      {\n        \"type\": \"text\",\n        \"text\": \"已导航到: https://www.douyin.com\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n🎉 当前标签页导航指令已发送！"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":3286,"aggregated":"🔄 在当前标签页打开抖音...\n在当前标签页导航到: https://www.douyin.com\n✅ MCP连接成功\n📤 已发送获取当前URL请求\n📥 当前标签页信息接收完成\n📤 已发送导航请求\n📥 导航响应: {\n  \"id\": 6,\n  \"result\": {\n    \"content\": [\n      {\n        \"type\": \"text\",\n        \"text\": \"已导航到: https://www.douyin.com\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n🎉 当前标签页导航指令已发送！","cwd":"C:\\Users\\lenovo\\.openclaw\\workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1772116748760}}
{"type":"message","id":"9033f126","parentId":"dee3da12","timestamp":"2026-02-26T14:40:07.277Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                                                                                                        很好！**当前标签页导航指令已发送成功** 🎉\n\n但是根据之前的经验，这可能还是会在扩展连接的标签页中打开，而不是您当前看到的前台标签页。\n\n## 🔍 根本问题分析\n\n问题的核心是：**Chrome扩展连接到了后台的标签页**，而不是您当前正在查看的前台标签页。\n\n### 技术原因：\n1. 扩展通过 `chrome.debugger` API 附加到特定标签页\n2. 默认可能附加到第一个或某个特定标签页\n3. 没有自动切换到用户当前查看的标签页\n\n## 🛠️ 解决方案\n\n### 方案一：修改扩展配置\n在扩展选项中启用\"自动附加所有标签页\"或\"附加到当前标签页\"\n\n### 方案二：使用JavaScript直接操作\n```javascript\n// 在当前窗口的当前标签页导航\nchrome.tabs.update({url: \"https://www.douyin.com\"});\n```\n\n### 方案三：手动切换（最简单）\n1. 找到被扩展控制的标签页（可能有抖音页面）\n2. 手动切换到该标签页\n3. 或者直接在当前标签页手动输入网址\n\n## 📋 验证方法\n\n让我检查扩展当前附加到哪个标签页"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_548ec9ecf210441c88dc3e53","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\lenovo\\.openclaw\\workspace\\check_attached_tabs.js","content":"const WebSocket = require('ws');\n\nconsole.log('🔍 检查扩展附加的标签页...');\n\nconst wsUrl = 'ws://127.0.0.1:30000/mcp';\n\nconst message = {\n  jsonrpc: \"2.0\",\n  id: 7,\n  method: \"tools/call\",\n  params: {\n    name: \"claw_get_current_url\",\n    arguments: {}\n  }\n};\n\nconsole.log('获取扩展当前控制的标签页信息...');\n\ntry {\n    const ws = new WebSocket(wsUrl);\n    \n    ws.on('open', function open() {\n        console.log('✅ MCP连接成功');\n        ws.send(JSON.stringify(message));\n        console.log('📤 已发送检查请求');\n    });\n    \n    ws.on('message', function incoming(data) {\n        const response = JSON.parse(data.toString());\n        \n        if (response.result && response.result.content) {\n            const tabInfo = JSON.parse(response.result.content[0].text);\n            console.log('📊 扩展当前控制的标签页:');\n            console.log('   URL:', tabInfo.url);\n            console.log('   标题:', tabInfo.title);\n            console.log('   \\n💡 这说明扩展控制的是这个标签页');\n            console.log('   📍 导航操作会在这个标签页中进行');\n        }\n        \n        ws.close();\n        process.exit(0);\n    });\n    \n    setTimeout(() => {\n        console.log('⏰ 响应超时');\n        ws.close();\n        process.exit(1);\n    }, 10000);\n    \n} catch (error) {\n    console.log('💥 测试异常:', error.message);\n    process.exit(1);\n}"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":82169,"output":749,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":82918,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772116748778}}
