{"type":"message","id":"6d8dd781","parentId":"b54822bc","timestamp":"2026-02-26T14:57:59.948Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"      【心跳检查 - 第二轮：违规监控检查】\n\n⚠️ 重要发现：MCP工具调用失败\n\n违规内容：\n- `claw_navigate` 工具调用失败：无已附加标签页\n- 扩展没有正确附加到浏览器标签页\n- 导航指令无法执行\n\n已修正：\n- 已使用替代方案 (`chrome.tabs.create`)\n- 已记录技术问题\n\n原因分析：\n- 扩展可能没有正确附加到标签页\n- 或者附加的标签页已关闭\n\n改进建议：\n- ✅ 已使用备用API方案\n- ✅ 已成功发送导航指令\n- ✅ 记录了技术问题供后续修复\n\n【系统状态】\n- 当前时间：2026-02-26 22:57 (GMT+8)\n- 心跳轮次：第二轮（违规监控检查）\n- 磁盘空间：正常\n- 内存使用：正常\n\n状态：已处理技术问题，系统运行正常"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":95552,"output":202,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":95754,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772117856984}}
{"type":"message","id":"721d8764","parentId":"6d8dd781","timestamp":"2026-02-26T14:58:55.858Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"9beeb10c-efdc-40d5-8920-15605cb712bf\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"openclaw-control-ui\",\n  \"sender\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Thu 2026-02-26 22:58 GMT+8] 需要验证这个问题【问题总结 根本原因：扩展配置中的 openMode 设置为 'current'（当前页），导致所有导航操作都在当前控制的标签页中进行。 解决方案：使用 chrome.tabs.create API 强制在新标签页中打开。 🎯 当前状态 所有4个导航指令已经成功发送到浏览器扩展。扩展应该会： 创建4个新标签页 在每个标签页中打开对应的链接 标签页在后台打开（不激活） 您现在应该能在浏览器中看到4个新标签页，分别包含： 瓦力AI自习室 本地n8n工作流 n8n workflows页面 即刻AIGC商店 需要我帮您验证这些标签页是否确实打开了吗？ 🔧】"}],"timestamp":1772117935845}}
{"type":"message","id":"d09efe75","parentId":"721d8764","timestamp":"2026-02-26T15:01:05.167Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"让我帮您验证这些标签页是否确实打开了。首先让我检查当前浏览器中的所有标签页状态"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_cc5f7b1554a84ab2aa1cc08e","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\lenovo\\.openclaw\\workspace\\verify_tabs.js","content":"const WebSocket = require('ws');\n\nconsole.log('🔍 验证标签页是否成功打开...');\n\nconst wsUrl = 'ws://127.0.0.1:30000/mcp';\n\n// 获取所有标签页信息\nconst getTabsMessage = {\n  jsonrpc: \"2.0\",\n  id: 17,\n  method: \"tools/call\",\n  params: {\n    name: \"claw_evaluate_js\",\n    arguments: {\n      expression: `\n        chrome.tabs.query({}).then(tabs => {\n          const result = {\n            total: tabs.length,\n            tabs: tabs.map(tab => ({\n              id: tab.id,\n              title: tab.title,\n              url: tab.url,\n              active: tab.active,\n              windowId: tab.windowId\n            }))\n          };\n          JSON.stringify(result);\n        });\n      `\n    }\n  }\n};\n\nconsole.log('检查浏览器中的所有标签页...');\n\ntry {\n    const ws = new WebSocket(wsUrl);\n    \n    ws.on('open', function open() {\n        console.log('✅ MCP连接成功');\n        ws.send(JSON.stringify(getTabsMessage));\n        console.log('📤 已发送检查请求');\n    });\n    \n    ws.on('message', function incoming(data) {\n        const response = JSON.parse(data.toString());\n        \n        if (response.id === 17) {\n            if (response.result && response.result.content) {\n                const tabsInfo = JSON.parse(response.result.content[0].text);\n                console.log(`📊 浏览器中共有 ${tabsInfo.total} 个标签页`);\n                \n                // 查找N8N相关的标签页\n                const n8nTabs = tabsInfo.tabs.filter(tab => \n                    tab.url && (\n                        tab.url.includes('rrairr.cn') ||\n                        tab.url.includes('localhost:5678') ||\n                        tab.url.includes('jiruikeji.top') ||\n                        tab.title.includes('n8n') ||\n                        tab.title.includes('N8N')\n                    )\n                );\n                \n                if (n8nTabs.length > 0) {\n                    console.log(`✅ 找到 ${n8nTabs.length} 个N8N相关标签页:`);\n                    n8nTabs.forEach((tab, index) => {\n                        console.log(`   ${index + 1}. ${tab.title} - ${tab.url} ${tab.active ? '(活动标签页)' : ''}`);\n                    });\n                } else {\n                    console.log('❌ 没有找到N8N相关的标签页');\n                    console.log('📋 所有标签页:');\n                    tabsInfo.tabs.slice(0, 10).forEach((tab, index) => {\n                        console.log(`   ${index + 1}. ${tab.title} - ${tab.url}`);\n                    });\n                    if (tabsInfo.tabs.length > 10) {\n                        console.log(`   ... 还有 ${tabsInfo.tabs.length - 10} 个标签页`);\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            ws.close();\n        }\n    });\n    \n    ws.on('error', function error(err) {\n        console.log('❌ 连接错误:', err.message);\n        process.exit(1);\n    });\n    \n    setTimeout(() => {\n        console.log('⏰ 响应超时');\n        ws.close();\n        process.exit(1);\n    }, 10000);\n    \n} catch (error) {\n    console.log('💥 测试异常:', error.message);\n    process.exit(1);\n}"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":96005,"output":954,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":96959,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772117935855}}
