{"type":"message","id":"e1f2ade0","parentId":"55c5bead","timestamp":"2026-02-26T15:30:48.822Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_9b20f887491444d5b9694966","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Command still running (session kind-harbor, pid 26764). Use process (list/poll/log/write/kill/clear/remove) for follow-up."}],"details":{"status":"running","sessionId":"kind-harbor","pid":26764,"startedAt":1772119838800,"cwd":"C:\\Users\\lenovo\\.openclaw\\workspace","tail":"🔍 检查可用的MCP工具...\n✅ MCP连接成功\n📤 已发送工具列表请求\n\n🛠️ 可用的工具列表:\n   1. claw_get_bookmarks - 获取所有书签（扁平列表，含标题/URL/ID）\n   2. claw_get_bookmark_tree - 获取完整书签树形结构（含文件夹层级）\n   3. claw_search_bookmarks - 按关键词搜索书签\n   4. claw_create_bookmark - 新建书签\n   5. claw_update_bookmark - 修改书签标题或URL\n   6. claw_delete_bookmark - 删除书签\n   7. claw_create_folder - 新建书签文件夹\n   8. claw_move_bookmark - 移动书签到其他文件夹\n   9. claw_navigate - 打开指定网址\n   10. claw_get_current_url - 获取当前标签页URL和标题\n   11. claw_click_element - 点击页面元素（CSS选择器）\n   12. claw_fill_input - 向输入框填写文本\n   13. claw_take_screenshot - 截取当前页面截图（返回base64 PNG）\n   14. claw_get_page_content - 获取页面HTML或纯文本内容\n   15. claw_evaluate_js - 在页面执行JavaScript并返回结果\n   16. claw_scroll - 滚动页面\n   17. claw_wait - 等待指定毫秒（最多5000）\n"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1772119848813}}
